guide.airdefense.page.34:
REPAIRS

A damaged vehicle mends:
- with a repair kit (right-click the vehicle; 4 iron + redstone) - a quarter of its strength;
- next to a recovery vehicle (BREM-1, M88) standing still - 3% a second;
- by a town's hangar - 1% a second.
TOS-1A: 24 thermobaric rockets at short range.
